+# RLHF / Retrain playbook (operator-guided)
+
+Overview
+- This playbook describes steps to convert feedback captured in the feedback UI into a reward model dataset, train a reward model, and fine-tune the policy model using PEFT/LoRA. Every step must be attested and evidence uploaded.
+
+Steps (high level)
+1. Export feedback entries from /data/feedback.json (quality checks & dedup)
+2. Construct pairwise preference dataset and split into train/val
+3. Train reward model (log to MLflow)
+4. Validate reward model via evaluation harness
+5. Fine-tune base model using PEFT/LoRA (log artifacts & SBOM)
+6. Register new model in registry and run policy evaluation + canary A/B
+7. If canary passes and policy allows, promote and attest promotion
+
+Notes
+- Use services/feedback/feedback_ui.py to export feedback.
+- Attest pre/post states using services/ops/oncall_playbook_runner.py
+
