+# Aegis AI Platform additions (RAG, Prompt Registry, LLM Proxy, Agent Orchestrator, Eval, Canary, RLHF)
+
+This patch implements the key building blocks to evolve Aegis into an AI platform:
+- RAG microservice (Milvus-backed) for retrieval and context composition
+- Prompt Registry + Playground with template versioning and optional cosign signing
+- LLM serving proxy with token accounting and quota checks
+- Agent orchestrator with tool adapters (search + sandboxed exec) and policy checks
+- Evaluation harness that logs to MLflow and supports A/B testing
+- Feedback UI for RLHF data capture and a retrain playbook stub
+- Canary A/B pipeline integration and attestation hooks
+- Grafana dashboard JSON for AI KPIs
+- Sandbox runner helpers using Docker for tool adapter isolation
+
+Next steps:
+- Provision Milvus and MLflow in your cluster (or use managed services)
+- Configure COSIGN_KEY_REF, EVIDENCE_BUCKET, POLICY_ENGINE_URL, and LLM upstream
+- Deploy self-hosted runners for TPU/Neuron for vendor builds
+- Wire Prometheus and Grafana to collect/visualize metrics
